+        {"Over voltage fault, check voltage is below set limit", "过压故障：请确认电压低于设定的上限"},
+        {"Under voltage fault, check voltage is above set limit. If using a power supply make sure the current limit is high enough.", "欠压故障：请确认电压高于设定的下限。如果用的是稳压电源，请确认它的限流值足够大。"},
